  "ruleText": "Par 208.02 Failure to Appear. The board shall postpone the hearing if the parolee, parole officer, or parolee’s attorney are unable to attend due to circumstances beyond their control.\n\nSource. #7149, eff 12-7-99, EXPIRED: 12-7-07\n\nNew. #9070, INTERIM, eff 1-11-08, EXPIRED: 7-9-08\n\nNew. #9254, eff 9-6-08; ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17",
